#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:2
msgid "Manage your desktop notifications"
msgstr "데스크톱 알림 관리"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:16
msgid "Enable notifications"
msgstr "알림 활성화"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:18
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v9.9 and desktop app v5.5, Mattermost prompts you to "
"enable notifications in the desktop app the first time you connect to a "
"Mattermost server."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v9.9 및 데스크톱 앱 v5.5부터, OKR.BEST는 OKR.BEST 서버에 처음 연결할 때 "
"데스크톱 앱에서 알림을 활성화하라는 안내를 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:20
msgid "An example of a Mattermost desktop app notification prompt."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱 알림 안내의 예시."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:24
msgid ""
"When you select **Allow**, you won't be asked again. You'll start "
"receiving notifications in the desktop app for all Mattermost activity "
"with `badges <#badge-based-notifications>`__, `banner alerts <#banner-"
"alerts>`__ and `sounds <#notification-sounds>`__. See the section below "
"on `customizing your notifications <#customize-your-notifications>`__ "
"based on how you prefer to be notified about Mattermost activity in the "
"desktop app."
msgstr ""
"**Allow**\\ 를 선택하면 다시 묻지 않습니다. 모든 OKR.BEST 활동에 대해 `배지 "
"<#badge-based-notifications>`__, `배너 알림 <#banner-alerts>`__, `소리 "
"<#notification-sounds>`__\\ 로 데스크톱 앱에서 알림을 받기 시작합니다. 데스크톱 "
"앱에서 OKR.BEST 활동에 대해 알림받기를 원하는 방식에 따라 `알림 사용자 지정 "
"<#customize-your-notifications>`__\\ 에 대한 아래 절을 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:25
msgid ""
"If you dismiss this prompt, you won't receive Mattermost notifications in"
" the desktop app, and you'll be prompted again the next time you open "
"Mattermost in the desktop app, or go to **Settings > Notifications > "
"Desktop and mobile notifications**."
msgstr ""
"이 안내를 닫으면 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST 알림을 받지 않으며, 다음에 데스크톱 "
"앱에서 OKR.BEST를 열거나 **설정 > 알림 > Desktop and mobile "
"notifications**\\ 로 이동할 때 다시 안내가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:26
msgid ""
"If you select **Deny** or **Deny Permanently**, you won't be asked again."
" You won't receive Mattermost notifications in the desktop app. You can "
"change this preference by :ref:`editing the server connection <end-user-"
"guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces:edit a server>` to "
":ref:`manage your notification permissions <end-user-guide/preferences"
"/connect-multiple-workspaces:manage system permissions>`."
msgstr ""
"**Deny** 또는 **Deny Permanently**\\ 를 선택하면 다시 묻지 않습니다. 데스크톱 "
"앱에서 OKR.BEST 알림을 받지 않습니다. :ref:`서버 연결을 편집 <end-user-"
"guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces:edit a server>`\\ 해 :ref:`알림 "
"권한을 관리 <end-user-guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces:manage "
"system permissions>`\\ 하면 이 설정을 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:30
msgid ""
"You may also need to enable notifications in Windows, macOS, or Linux for"
" Mattermost by changing your System Preferences."
msgstr ""
"시스템 환경설정을 변경해 Windows, macOS 또는 Linux에서 OKR.BEST에 대한 알림을 "
"활성화해야 할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:33
msgid "Badge-based notifications"
msgstr "배지 기반 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:35
msgid "Mattermost desktop app icons display the following types of badges:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱 아이콘은 다음 유형의 배지를 표시합니다:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:37
msgid ""
"A numbered badge for unread :ref:`direct <end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/channel-types:direct message channels>` :ref:`group <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/channel-types:group message channels>` messages, "
":doc:`@mentions </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-"
"keywords-notifications>`, and :doc:`keywords </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications>` you're actively watching. "
"|numbered-badge|"
msgstr ""
"읽지 않은 :ref:`개인 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:direct "
"message channels>` 메시지, :ref:`그룹 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types:group message channels>` 메시지, :doc:`@멘션 </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications>`, 적극적으로 "
"지켜보는 :doc:`키워드 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-"
"keywords-notifications>`\\ 에 대한 숫자 배지. |numbered-badge|"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:11
msgid ""
"A numbered badge means you have at least 1 unread message, @mention, or "
"one of your keywords has triggered a notification."
msgstr ""
"숫자 배지는 읽지 않은 메시지나 @멘션이 1개 이상 있거나 키워드 중 하나가 알림을 "
"트리거했음을 의미합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:38
msgid "A dot badge for unread activity. |dot-badge|"
msgstr "읽지 않은 활동에 대한 점 배지. |dot-badge|"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:7
msgid ""
"A dot on the badge means you have unread activity in at least one channel"
" you're a member of."
msgstr ""
"배지의 점은 구성원으로 속한 채널 중 하나 이상에 읽지 않은 활동이 있음을 "
"의미합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:41
msgid "Banner alerts"
msgstr "배너 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:43
msgid ""
"Banner alerts in the desktop app are popup windows that display for a "
"limited time in the top right corner of your screen that summarizes the "
"new activity."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 앱의 배너 알림은 화면 오른쪽 위 모서리에 일정 시간 동안 표시되어 새 "
"활동을 요약해 주는 팝업 창입니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:46
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "알림 소리"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:48
msgid "By default, desktop app notifications include audible sounds."
msgstr "기본적으로 데스크톱 앱 알림에는 들리는 소리가 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:51
msgid "Customize your notifications"
msgstr "알림 사용자 지정"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:53
msgid ""
"By default, you are notified when you're @mentioned, when you receive a "
"direct or group message, or for matches to keywords you're following."
msgstr ""
"기본적으로 @멘션되거나, 개인 메시지나 그룹 메시지를 받거나, 팔로우 중인 "
"키워드와 일치하는 경우 알림을 받습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:55
msgid ""
"Want to receive notifications about replies to threads you’re following? "
"Select **Notify me about replies to threads I’m following**."
msgstr ""
"팔로우 중인 스레드의 답글에 대한 알림을 받고 싶으신가요? **Notify me about "
"replies to threads I'm following**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:57
msgid ""
"Want notifications for all new messages? Select **Desktop and mobile "
"notifications > All new messages**"
msgstr ""
"모든 새 메시지에 대해 알림을 받고 싶으신가요? **Desktop and mobile "
"notifications > All new messages**\\ 를 선택하세요"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:59
msgid ""
"Desktop app users can also :doc:`customize their desktop app experience "
"</end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience>` further "
"based on their platform operating system."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 앱 사용자는 플랫폼 운영 체제에 따라 :doc:`데스크톱 앱 환경을 추가로 "
"사용자 지정 </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-"
"experience>`\\ 할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:62
msgid "Change or disable sounds"
msgstr "소리 변경 또는 비활성화"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:64
msgid ""
"You can change or disable notification sounds by going to **Desktop "
"notification sounds > Message notification sound**."
msgstr ""
"**Desktop notification sounds > Message notification sound**\\ 으로 이동해 알림 "
"소리를 변경하거나 비활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:67
msgid "Incoming Call notifications"
msgstr "수신 통화 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:69
msgid ""
"Want to hear a sound when a Mattermost call starts? If your Mattermost "
"admin :ref:`enables this Beta feature <administration-guide/configure"
"/plugins-configuration-settings:enable call ringing>`, you can choose the"
" sound that plays when a call is started within a direct or group message"
" by going to **Desktop notification sounds > Incoming call sound**."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 통화가 시작될 때 소리를 듣고 싶으신가요? OKR.BEST 관리자가 :ref:`이 "
"베타 기능을 활성화 <administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-"
"settings:enable call ringing>`\\ 하면, **Desktop notification sounds > "
"Incoming call sound**\\ 로 이동해 개인 메시지나 그룹 메시지에서 통화가 시작될 "
"때 재생되는 소리를 선택할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:72
msgid "Disable all desktop notifications"
msgstr "모든 데스크톱 알림 비활성화"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:74
msgid ""
"Select **Desktop and mobile notifications > Nothing** to disable all "
"desktop and :doc:`web notifications </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-web-notifications>`."
msgstr ""
"**Desktop and mobile notifications > Nothing**\\ 을 선택해 모든 데스크톱 알림과 "
":doc:`웹 알림 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-"
"notifications>`\\ 을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:76
msgid ""
"Clear the **Use different settings for my mobile devices** to "
"additionally disable all Mattermost mobile notifications everywhere you "
"use Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"**Use different settings for my mobile devices**\\ 의 체크를 해제하면 OKR.BEST를 "
"사용하는 모든 곳에서 모든 OKR.BEST 모바일 알림도 추가로 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:78
msgid ""
"Additionally, macOS users can disable notifications for all unread "
"activity in the desktop app by :doc:`customizing your desktop app "
"experience </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-"
"experience>` to disable the **Show red badge on Dock icon to indicate "
"unread messages** option."
msgstr ""
"또한 macOS 사용자는 :doc:`데스크톱 앱 환경을 사용자 지정 </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience>`\\ 해 **Show red badge "
"on Dock icon to indicate unread messages** 옵션을 비활성화함으로써 데스크톱 "
"앱의 모든 읽지 않은 활동에 대한 알림을 비활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:81
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "자주 묻는 질문"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:84
msgid "What does a Mattermost icon with an exclamation point mean?"
msgstr "느낌표가 있는 OKR.BEST 아이콘은 무엇을 의미하나요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:86
msgid ""
"A Mattermost logo with an exclamation point means you're logged out of at"
" least 1 Mattermost server you connect to using the desktop app."
msgstr ""
"느낌표가 있는 OKR.BEST 로고는 데스크톱 앱으로 연결하는 OKR.BEST 서버 중 하나 "
"이상에서 로그아웃되었음을 의미합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:89
msgid ""
"A Mattermost icon with an exclamation point means that you're logged out "
"of at least 1 Mattermost server you connect to using the desktop app. Log"
" back in to any servers as needed. See the :doc:`Connect to multiple "
"workspaces </end-user-guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces>` "
"documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"느낌표가 있는 OKR.BEST 아이콘은 데스크톱 앱으로 연결하는 OKR.BEST 서버 중 하나 "
"이상에서 로그아웃되었음을 의미합니다. 필요에 따라 서버에 다시 로그인하세요. "
"자세한 내용은 :doc:`여러 워크스페이스에 연결 </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/connect-multiple-workspaces>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications.rst:91
msgid ""
"If the icon continues to display, refresh the **Playbooks** and/or "
"**Boards** tabs located at the top of the desktop app window."
msgstr ""
"아이콘이 계속 표시되면 데스크톱 앱 창 상단에 있는 **Playbooks** 및/또는 "
"**Boards** 탭을 새로 고치세요."

